      "Configure Amazon Route 53 latency-based routing. Enable S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) to replicate static assets to S3 buckets in multiple AWS Regions worldwide, and deploy duplicate ALBs and EC2 instances in each region. Restrict S3 bucket access using VPC endpoints.",
