      "Deploy the application on Amazon EC2 instances across multiple Availability Zones within an Auto Scaling group behind a Network Load Balancer (NLB). Configure the Auto Scaling group to use ELB health checks and a scheduled scaling policy. Purchase Spot Instances to cover the 24/7 baseline capacity, and allow the Auto Scaling group to launch On-Demand instances during traffic surges.",
      "Deploy the application on Amazon EC2 instances across multiple Availability Zones within an Auto Scaling group behind an Application Load Balancer (ALB). Configure the Auto Scaling group to use ELB health checks and a target tracking scaling policy. Purchase a 1-year Compute Savings Plan to cover the baseline instance capacity, and allow the Auto Scaling group to launch On-Demand instances during traffic surges.",
