      "Deploy the EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group across multiple Availability Zones using standard On-Demand instances for all capacity. Create a dedicated IAM user for each EC2 instance with inline policies, and embed the generated access keys into a custom Amazon Machine Image (AMI) baked with AWS KMS encryption.",
