      "Install and configure the unified Amazon CloudWatch agent on the EC2 instances to collect and publish OS-level memory utilization metrics. Create an Amazon CloudWatch alarm that triggers when memory utilization exceeds 85%. Configure an Amazon EventBridge rule that detects the alarm state change and invokes an AWS Lambda function. Configure the Lambda function to use AWS Systems Manager Run Command to restart the seat reservation service on the affected instance."
