      "Configure the booking service to send booking events to a single Amazon SQS FIFO queue. Create an AWS Lambda function triggered by the queue to sequentially call the e-ticket, loyalty points, and ground handling APIs, sending failed requests to an Amazon SQS dead-letter queue (DLQ).",
      "Configure the booking service to write booking records to an Amazon Kinesis data stream. Deploy consumer applications using the Kinesis Client Library (KCL) on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group for each downstream task to read and process records from the stream."
