      "Convert the database into an Amazon Aurora Global Database with a secondary DB cluster in the us-west-2 Region. Configure an Auto Scaling group with a desired capacity of 0 in us-west-2, and scale it out during a disaster.",
      "Use AWS Backup to schedule hourly cross-Region snapshots of the Aurora cluster to the us-west-2 Region. In the event of a disaster, restore the database from the most recent snapshot and launch EC2 instances."
