      "Deploy the application tier on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group behind an Application Load Balancer in the us-west-2 Region. Configure an Amazon Route 53 simple routing policy to distribute player traffic across both ALBs, and rely on the secondary ALB to detect regional outages and initiate failover."
