      "Upload the images to Amazon S3 Standard. Configure an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition objects to S3 Standard-Infrequent Access (S3 Standard-IA) after 30 days, transition to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after 365 days, and expire objects after 2,555 days."
