      "Upgrade the EC2 instances to larger compute-optimized instance types with Provisioned IOPS SSD (io2) EBS volumes. Configure an Amazon EventBridge scheduled rule to scale the compute tier before sales, and store generated PDF documents on a shared Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) file system.",
