    question_en: "A regional airline is designing the architecture for its flight booking and e-ticketing platform on AWS. The platform needs to handle frequent flight schedule searches, seat reservation transactions, and PDF boarding pass distribution.\n\nThe solution must satisfy the following requirements:\n- Maintain transactional integrity for reservations in a relational database with automatic failover capability across multiple Availability Zones.\n- Scale read performance to support heavy flight search traffic and prevent database connection exhaustion during sudden spikes in ticket sales.\n- Store passenger boarding pass PDFs durably and allow passengers to download them securely using time-limited links without routing file transfers through backend application servers.\n- Provide the LEAST operational overhead for management and maintenance.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
