      "Establish an AWS Site-to-Site VPN connection between the on-premises data center and the VPC. Deploy an Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS) file system. Use AWS Storage Gateway File Gateway to replicate files from the on-premises file servers to Amazon EFS.",
      "Establish an AWS Direct Connect connection between the on-premises data center and the VPC. Deploy an Amazon FSx for Lustre file system linked to an Amazon S3 bucket. Use AWS Snowball Edge devices to perform continuous data synchronization from on-premises to Amazon S3.",
