      "Establish an AWS Direct Connect connection between the on-premises data center and the VPC. Deploy the application on Amazon EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group across multiple Availability Zones behind an Application Load Balancer. Create an Amazon FSx for Lustre file system linked to an Amazon S3 bucket to provide shared storage for the Windows application."
