      "Configure an Amazon ElastiCache for Memcached cluster to cache both DynamoDB items and Aurora PostgreSQL query results using application-level lazy loading. Enable sticky sessions (session affinity) on the Application Load Balancer to store user session state on the EC2 instances.",
