    question_en: "A digital healthcare startup, PulseCare Analytics, stores anonymized patient consultation records and IoT health monitor logs as JSON files in an Amazon S3 bucket. The data structure frequently evolves as new health monitoring devices are integrated. Clinical analysts and executive stakeholders require interactive visual dashboards to analyze patient recovery metrics and clinic performance indicators. The startup has a small IT team and requires a fully serverless solution that automatically discovers new data schemas and minimizes ongoing operational maintenance.\n\nWhich combination of AWS services should a solutions architect recommend to meet these requirements?",
