      "Configure Amazon S3 Event Notifications to invoke an AWS Lambda function to validate metadata and record initial details in DynamoDB. Have the Lambda function submit a job to AWS Batch, using a managed compute environment configured with EC2 Spot Instances to execute the containerized OCR and redaction workflow."
