      "Deploy all EC2 instances within a Cluster placement group in a single Availability Zone. Configure the Auto Scaling group to use 100% Spot Instances for both the baseline and scaling capacity. Store temporary AWS credentials in an AWS Systems Manager Parameter Store SecureString parameter and query it from the application at startup."
