      "Configure an Amazon EBS io2 Block Express volume with Multi-Attach enabled to share media assets across EC2 instances in multiple Availability Zones, and configure AWS Data Lifecycle Manager (DLM) to archive inactive files. Attach an Amazon EBS General Purpose SSD (gp2) volume to each instance for local temporary scratch space."
