      "Attach an IAM role with S3 permissions to the EC2 instances. Enable S3 Versioning on the source S3 bucket. Create an AWS Lambda function triggered by S3 Event Notifications to copy new objects to the destination S3 bucket. Create an S3 Lifecycle rule on the source bucket to expire noncurrent object versions after 90 days.",
      "Attach an IAM role with S3 permissions to an instance profile for the EC2 instances. Enable S3 Versioning on both the source and destination S3 buckets. Configure Amazon S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) on the source bucket using an IAM role that allows S3 replication. Create an S3 Lifecycle rule on the source bucket to transition noncurrent versions to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after 90 days.",
      "Create an IAM user with programmatic access keys and store the credentials in the EC2 instance configuration files. Enable S3 Versioning only on the source S3 bucket. Configure Amazon S3 Cross-Region Replication (CRR) using a bucket policy. Create an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition current object versions to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after 90 days."
