      "Deploy EC2 instances in an Auto Scaling group across multiple Availability Zones behind an Application Load Balancer. Attach an Amazon EBS Multi-Attach Provisioned IOPS SSD (io2) volume to the instances to share files, and use Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager (Amazon DLM) to archive older files."
