    question_en: "A manufacturing company operates thousands of IoT sensors across its assembly plants to monitor equipment telemetry. The streaming sensor data must be ingested continuously and stored for historical analysis. Company compliance mandates that all data at rest must be encrypted using encryption keys where the company can customize key access policies and enable automatic annual key rotation. Data analysts need to run ad-hoc SQL queries against the stored telemetry data periodically without provisioning or maintaining compute infrastructure.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead?",
