      "Create Service Control Policies (SCPs) in AWS Organizations that directly grant DynamoDB PutItem permissions to the specific EC2 instance IDs across all organizational units (OUs).",
      "Attach an IAM role with the required DynamoDB permissions to an instance profile and assign it to the EC2 instances in each account, enabling the tracking application to automatically obtain temporary credentials.",
      "Create individual AWS CloudTrail trails in each member account to deliver logs to local Amazon S3 buckets, and configure Amazon EventBridge rules in each account to periodically replicate log files to the management account."
